l-to-all\",\"to\",\"total。\",\"total\",\"topoopt\",\"topo\",\"topology\",\"die\",\"die。\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":152},{\"match\":\"AlltoAll\",\"offset\":501},{\"match\":\"AlltoAll\",\"offset\":1870},{\"match\":\"AlltoAll\",\"offset\":1919},{\"match\":\"total\",\"offset\":2092},{\"match\":\"total。\",\"offset\":2244},{\"match\":\"AlltoAll\",\"offset\":2369},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":3531},{\"match\":\"all-to-all\",\"offset\":3550},{\"match\":\"Topology\",\"offset\":3726},{\"match\":\"all-to-all\",\"offset\":3965},{\"match\":\"TopoOpt\",\"offset\":4417},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":4447},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":4605},{\"match\":\"die。\",\"offset\":4872}],\"excerpt\":\"NVSwitch 和 NVLink 是 NVIDIA 的 GPU 间高速互联技术，构成单节点内多 GPU 通信的基础架构。NVLink 是 GPU-to-GPU 的点对点直连链路（第三代 NVLink 带宽 300GB/s per link, A100 使用 12 条 NVLink 实现 600GB/s 双向带宽），NVSwitch 是一个独立的交换芯片，将节点内所有 GPU 的 NVLink 端口全互联，实现所有 GPU 对之间的全带宽 non-blocking 通信（A100 HGX 平台：6 个 NVSwitch 互联 8 个 A100 GPU，每 GPU 对外总带宽 900GB/s）。NVSwitch 是全双工、无阻塞的 crossbar 交换结构，任何 GPU pair 可同时以全带宽通信，不受其他 pair 影响。\\n从硬件架…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/3D Near-Memory Processing (3D NMP) for MoE LLM Inference.md\",\"basename\":\"3D Near-Memory Processing (3D NMP) for MoE LLM Inference\",\"score\":176.41825814425735,\"foundWords\":[\"all\",\"all-to-all\",\"to\",\"token\",\"die\",\"die**：每个节点包含可配置的\",\"die**：通过\",\"die，存储\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":101},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":113},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":369},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":425},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":437},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":486},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":616},{\"match\":\"Die**：每个节点包含可配置的\",\"offset\":762},{\"match\":\"Die**：通过\",\"offset\":875},{\"match\":\"die，存储\",\"offset\":909},{\"match\":\"Token\",\"offset\":1122},{\"match\":\"token\",\"offset\":1143},{\"match\":\"all-to-all\",\"offset\":1266},{\"match\":\"all\",\"offset\":1978}],\"excerpt\":\"3D NMP 是通过 Hybrid Bonding 技术将 DRAM die 垂直堆叠在逻辑 die 之上，利用高密度 Cu-Cu 直接键合互连提供高带宽、高能效的近存计算架构。与 GPU 共享内存架构不同，3D NMP 中每个计算节点拥有独立的 local memory bank，通过 2D mesh NoC 互联，形成分布式内存+分布式计算的计算环境。\\n术语是什么？\\n3D Near-Memory Processing (3D NMP) 是一种将 DRAM 存储垂直堆叠在逻辑计算芯片之上的 3D 集成架构。与传统的 Processing-in-Memory (PIM) 将计算单元嵌入 DRAM die 内部不同，3D NMP 通过 Hybrid Bondin…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/BF16 Exponent Distribution and Redundancy in LLMs（LLM中BF16指数分布与冗余）.md\",\"basename\":\"BF16 Exponent Distribution and Redundancy in LLMs（LLM中BF16指数分布与冗余）\",\"score\":168.07483838548262,\"foundWords\":[\"allocation），top-3\",\"allocation\",\"top-7覆盖\",\"top-3\",\"top\",\"diet\",\"dietgpu/ans,\",\"dietgpu\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"allocation），top-3\",\"offset\":237},{\"match\":\"top-7覆盖\",\"offset\":272},{\"match\":\"top\",\"offset\":591},{\"match\":\"DietGPU/ANS,\",\"offset\":1475}],\"excerpt\":\"…现高度偏态分布。ZipServ和多个独立研究（DFloat11、ZipNN、Unweight）均证实：exponent的Shannon entropy仅2.57–2.74 bits（远低于8-bit allocation），top-3 exponent覆盖>67%权重，top-7覆盖>95%。这是因为LLM权重的值域集中在较窄范围（主要由模型初始化和训练动态决定），BF16的full exponent range（2^-126到2^127）大部分未被使用。相比之下，sign bit（1 bit，接近最大熵）和mantissa（7 bits，接近最大熵）基本不可压缩。这种偏态分布使exponent field成为lossless compression的主要目标：sign+mantissa 8 bits + compressed exponent ~2.6 bits = ~10.6 bits…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Adaptive Expert Skipping for MoE Inference.md\",\"basename\":\"Adaptive Expert Skipping for MoE Inference\",\"score\":160.59691486191736,\"foundWords\":[\"all\",\"to\",\"top2_indices\",\"top2\",\"top-2\",\"top-1\",\"top-k\",\"top\",\"token\",\"diep:\",\"diep\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"token\",\"offset\":147},{\"match\":\"DiEP\",\"offset\":171},{\"match\":\"Top-2\",\"offset\":233},{\"match\":\"toke\",\"offset\":424},{\"match\":\"top-\",\"offset\":435},{\"match\":\"toke\",\"offset\":500},{\"match\":\"-toke\",\"offset\":561},{\"match\":\"Di\",\"offset\":893},{\"match\":\"r tok\",\"offset\":1165},{\"match\":\"= to\",\"offset\":1209},{\"match\":\"][tok\",\"offset\":1233},{\"match\":\"s\",\"offset\":1539},{\"match\