","offset":1014},{"match":"all","offset":1100},{"match":"all","offset":1109},{"match":"all","offset":1144},{"match":"all","offset":1264},{"match":"all","offset":1358},{"match":"all","offset":1527},{"match":"all","offset":1536},{"match":"all","offset":1571},{"match":"all","offset":1858},{"match":"to","offset":1955},{"match":"token","offset":2173},{"match":"all-gather（减少传输延迟）","offset":2210},{"match":"all","offset":2322},{"match":"token","offset":2359},{"match":"token","offset":2645},{"match":"all-gather","offset":2657}],"excerpt":"## Expert Processing with Tensor Parallelism on NMP (NMP上的张量并行专家处理)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nExpert Processing with Tensor Parallelism on NMP 是 Stratum 中将 MoE expert 计算映射到 NMP logic die 多个 PU 上并行执行的核心调度策略。MoE 的每个 expert 执行三个级联 GeMM 操作（projection-up GeMM1: W_1 ∈ R^{K×N}, projection-up GeMM2: W_2 ∈ R^{K×N}, projectio…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Reconstruction Regularization for Expert Pruning.md","basename":"Reconstruction Regularization for Expert Pruning","score":116.7110760598899,"foundWords":["all","to","total_loss","total","token-level","token","diep:","diep"],"matches":[{"match":"token-leve","offset":249},{"match":"DiE","offset":334},{"match":"total_l","offset":1024},{"match":"d (","offset":1105},{"match":"nd","offset":1509},{"match":"total_l","offset":1524},{"match":"rn total_l","offset":1588},{"match":"ss_to","offset":1622},{"match":"* total_l","offset":1675},{"match":"es，D","offset":1977},{"match":"- Di","offset":2043}],"excerpt":"…∥_F，其中 F' 为应用 continuous relaxation 后的 pruned model 输出，F 为完整原始模型输出，∥·∥_F 为 Frobenius 范数。该正则项鼓励剪枝后模型的 token-level hidden states 与原始完整模型保持一致，相当于一种知识蒸馏的形式（无需单独的 teacher forward）。\n术语是什么？\n在 DiEP 中，Reconstruction Regularization 是与 Cross-Entropy Loss 共同优化的一项，总目标为 L = L_ce + λ·Φ。其作用机制：\n1. 原始模型 F(x) 在每个 MoE 层使用全部专家的 FFN 输出加权求和\n2. Pruned model F'(x) 使用 ᾱ_i^(l)（softmax 后的可学习重要性）和 β^(l) 对各专家输出加权\n3. Φ 计算两者在…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/On-Chip Ring Network for NMP (近存计算片上环形网络).md","basename":"On-Chip Ring Network for NMP (近存计算片上环形网络)","score":103.11797639525679,"foundWords":["all","all-gather","topology","token","die"],"matches":[{"match":"die","offset":131},{"match":"all-gather","offset":240},{"match":"All-Gather","offset":662},{"match":"token","offset":706},{"match":"all-gather","offset":750},{"match":"all","offset":807},{"match":"topology","offset":1186},{"match":"all-gather","offset":1328},{"match":"die","offset":1814},{"match":"die","offset":1871}],"excerpt":"On-Chip Ring Network 是 Stratum NMP logic die 上连接 16 个 Processing Units (PUs) 的 bidirectional ring-based interconnect 网络，用于支持 MoE 推理中的 collective 通信模式（all-gather, reduce-scatter, scalar exchange），避免 centralized global buffer 和 crossbar 带来的 scalability 和 physical design 复杂度。每个 ring link 提供 128 GB/s 带宽，aggregated ring bandwidth = 2.048 TB/s。R…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/gem5_Garnet Multi-Chiplet NoC Simulation Framework.md","basename":"gem5_Garnet Multi-Chiplet NoC Simulation Framework","score":98.9516768194229,"foundWords":["allocation","allocated","torus","topology","die"],"matches":[{"match":"die","offset":327},{"match":"allocation","offset":913},{"match":"allocated","offset":1033},{"match":"topology","offset":1494},{"match":"torus","offset":1509}],"excerpt":"…C 模型，提供 cycle-accurate 的 router、link、VC 和 flow control 模拟。HeteroGarnet 是 Garnet 的扩展，支持异构 chiplet 和多 die 间的 NoC 模拟。本文使用 gem5 + Garnet 构建 4-chiplet × shared interposer 多 chiplet 模拟环境（chiplet 和 interposer 均为 4×4 mesh、XY routing、3 VN、per-VN 2/4 VC、virtual cut-through flow control），评估 DFBM vs MTR/DeFT/RC 的 latency、throughput 和 PARSEC full-system speedup。\n从硬件架构角度拆解术语：\ngem5/Garnet 的模拟层次：(1) gem5 CPU mo…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/LLMCompass.md","basename":"LLMCompass","score":76.31976070883849,"foundWords":["all","all-to-all","to","tokens","die"],"matches":[{"match":"to","offset":41},{"match":"to","offset":113},{"match":"to","offset":196},{"match":"to","offset":305},{"match":"die","offset":531},{"mat