{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_eZVAe5WN6G4qyrvDpsfr3341","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/Wafer-Scale Engine (WSE _ 晶圆级引擎).md\",\"basename\":\"Wafer-Scale Engine (WSE _ 晶圆级引擎)\",\"score\":758.6889998308116,\"foundWords\":[\"wafer\",\"wafer-scale\",\"scale\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Wafer-Scale\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Wafer-Scale\",\"offset\":44},{\"match\":\"Wafer-Scale\",\"offset\":1463}],\"excerpt\":\"## Wafer-Scale Engine (WSE / 晶圆级引擎)\\n术语是什么？\\nWafer-Scale Engine (WSE) 是 Cerebras Systems 推出的晶圆级 AI 加速器芯片。与传统的 multi-die GPU 不同，WSE 在整片 300mm 硅晶圆上集成计算核心，消除了芯片间通信（off-chip）的带宽瓶颈。WSE-2（第二代）使用 TSMC 7nm 工艺，在 46,225 mm² 面积上集成 2.6 万亿晶体管、850,000 个 AI 核心、40 GB on-chip SRAM 和 20 PB/s 内存带宽。系统形态为 CS-2（单 WSE-2 芯片的整机…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Wafer-Scale Multi-Chiplet GPU for MoE Serving (晶圆级多芯粒GPU的MoE推理).md\",\"basename\":\"Wafer-Scale Multi-Chiplet GPU for MoE Serving (晶圆级多芯粒GPU的MoE推理)\",\"score\":651.6118864814571,\"foundWords\":[\"wafer\",\"wafer-scale\",\"wafer,\",\"wafer/interposer\",\"scale\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Wafer-Scale\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Wafer-Scale\",\"offset\":112},{\"match\":\"wafer/interposer\",\"offset\":233},{\"match\":\"Wafer\",\"offset\":387},{\"match\":\"Wafer-scale\",\"offset\":626},{\"match\":\"wafer\",\"offset\":704},{\"match\":\"Wafer-scale\",\"offset\":1841},{\"match\":\"wafer,\",\"offset\":2295},{\"match\":\"wafer\",\"offset\":2383},{\"match\":\"Scale\",\"offset\":2597}],\"excerpt\":\"## Wafer-Scale Multi-Chiplet GPU for MoE Serving (晶圆级多芯粒GPU的MoE推理)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nWafer-Scale Multi-Chiplet GPU 是将多个 GPU compute die 和 HBM die 通过先进封装技术（如 TSMC CoWoS/SoW, Samsung X-Cube, Intel EMIB）集成在单个 wafer/interposer 上的 GPU 架构。论文研究的两种具体拓扑：(1) **Tesla Dojo**：5×5 2D mesh，…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/System-on-Wafer (SoW) Technology (晶圆级系统集成技术).md\",\"basename\":\"System-on-Wafer (SoW) Technology (晶圆级系统集成技术)\",\"score\":375.36811720857503,\"foundWords\":[\"wafer\",\"wafer-scale\",\"scale\",\"scale——可容纳\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Wafer\",\"offset\":13},{\"match\":\"Wafer\",\"offset\":103},{\"match\":\"scale——可容纳\",\"offset\":308},{\"match\":\"wafer\",\"offset\":2120},{\"match\":\"wafer-scale\",\"offset\":2291},{\"match\":\"wafer\",\"offset\":2538},{\"match\":\"Scale\",\"offset\":2607}],\"excerpt\":\"## System-on-Wafer (SoW) Technology (晶圆级系统集成技术)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nSystem-on-Wafer (SoW) 是 TSMC 的晶圆级封装技术，将多个 compute die 和 HBM die 直接集成在单个硅晶圆上，通过 Local Silicon Interconnect (LSI) 和 XSR SerDes 实现 die-to-die 互联。与传统的 multi-chip module (MCM) 或 2.5D interposer 方案（如 CoWoS）相比，SoW 的显著差异在于 scale…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Expert Parallelism (EP _ 专家并行).md\",\"basename\":\"Expert Parallelism (EP _ 专家并行)\",\"score\":49.39392048474575,\"foundWords\":[\"wafer\",\"wafer-scale\",\"scale\",\"scalemoe:\",\"scalemoe\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"wafer-scale\",\"offset\":1263},{\"match\":\"Wafer-Scale\",\"offset\":2272},{\"match\":\"ScaleMoE\",\"offset\":4164},{\"match\":\"ScaleMoE\",\"offset\":4346},{\"match\":\"Wafer-Scale\",\"offset\":4772},{\"match\":\"ScaleMoE:\",\"offset\":5432},{\"match\":\"Scale\",\"offset\":5503},{\"match\":\"scale\",\"offset\":6887}],\"excerpt\":\"BTA 论文指出，在 wafer-scale 处理器上，EP 解决的是跨设备 expert 分布问题，但不能解决同一设备内 attention 与 expert 的 batch size 冲突。BTA 与 EP 是互补的：EP 跨晶圆/设备分布 expert，BTA 在同一设备内解耦 attention 和 expert 的 batch size。\\n术语一般如何实现？如何使用？\\n主流框架实现：\\n- Megatron-Core：通过 `moe_ep_size` 参数配置 EP 并行度，与 TP/DP/PP 混合使用。推荐 Mixtral-8x7B 在 64 GPU 上用 TP=1, EP=8, PP=4。\\n- De…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Two-Level Command Processor (两级命令处理器).md\",\"basename\":\"Two-Level Command Processor (两级命令处理器)\",\"score\":41.47648800198789,\"foundWords\":[\"wafer\",\"wafer-scale\",\"scale\",\"scaled\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"wafer-scale\",\"offset\":124},{\"match\":\"wafer\",\"offset\":222},{\"match\":\"wafer-scale\",\"offset\":547},{\"match\":\"wafer\",\"offset\":668},{\"match\":\"scaled\",\"offset\":2272},{\"match\":\"Scale\",\"offset\":2652}],\"excerpt\":\"Two-Level Command Processor (CP) 是论文为 wafer-scale multi-chiplet GPU 提出的架构扩展，将传统 GPU 的单层 Command Processor 重新设计为两级层次结构：(1) **Global CP**（wafer 级）——维护全系统 expert selection 和 placement 信息，运行 Task Allocation Algorithm 和 Data-Driven Predictor，负责将 MoE kernel 拆分为 per-die 子 kernel；(2) **Local CP**（每 die 内）——接收 Global CP 的子 kernel 和 prediction 配置…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Multi-Die Task Allocation for MoE (多Die MoE任务分配).md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Die Task Allocation for MoE (多Die MoE任务分配)\",\"score\":37.13912084440806,\"foundWords\":[\"wafer\",\"waferscale\",\"wafer-scale\",\"scale\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"wafer-scale\",\"offset\":128},{\"match\":\"waferscale\",\"offset\":2946},{\"match\":\"Scale\",\"offset\":3118}],\"excerpt\":\"Multi-Die Task Allocation 是运行在 wafer-scale GPU Global CP 上的启发式算法，将 MoE kernel 计算按 expert 拆分为 per-die 子任务，基于 expert 在各 die 上的分布信息和 cost model 将子任务分配到最优 die。核心创新是引入 **Candidate Mechanism**（扩展候选 die 到邻居 die，而不限于 expert 所在 die）和 **Block-Granularity Distribution**（以 block size=50 为单位分配请求，在效率和精度间折中）。该算法是 Insight 3（expert-placement-awar…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Expert Parallelism (专家并行).md\",\"basename\":\"Expert Parallelism (专家并行)\",\"score\":34.6598838034594,\"foundWords\":[\"wafer\",\"wafer-scale\",\"scale\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"**Wafer-sca\",\"offset\":4291},{\"match\":\"在 wafer-sca\",\"offset\":4326},{\"match\":\"在 waf\",\"offset\":4376},{\"match\":\"P sca\",\"offset\":5028}],\"excerpt\":\"- **Wafer-scale single-GPU-like EP**：在 wafer-scale multi-chiplet GPU 上，EP 意味着 expert 分布在 wafer 的不同 die 上（而非不同 GPU 节点）。由于 single-GPU-like programming model 不暴露 die-level 控制，论文通过硬件架构扩展（Global/Local CP + ATU/PDU + Task Allocation Algorithm）在硬件层实现 expert-placement-aware 的任务分配。关键挑战：local vs remote HBM acce…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Data-Driven Expert Predictor (数据驱动的专家预测器).md\",\"basename\":\"Data-Driven Expert Predictor (数据驱动的专家预测器)\",\"score\":34.48322061921944,\"foundWords\":[\"wafer\",\"wafer-scale\",\"scale\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"wafer-scale\",\"offset\":124},{\"match\":\"Wafer-scale\",\"offset\":583},{\"match\":\"Scale\",\"offset\":2467}],\"excerpt\":\"Data-Driven Expert Predictor 是运行在 wafer-scale GPU 的 Global Command Processor 上的轻量级预测算法，利用 cross-token heatmap（历史 expert selection 条件概率）在 MoE kernel launch 时预测下一 token 的热门 experts，生成 duplication guidance（cp_en bits）指导各 die 的 hardware-managed HBM 自动缓存远程热门 expert。Predictor 是 Insight 2（cross-hierarchy memory management）在 token-level 的具体…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Single-GPU-like Programming Model for Multi-Die GPU (多Die GPU的统一编程模型).md\",\"basename\":\"Single-GPU-like Programming Model for Multi-Die GPU (多Die GPU的统一编程模型)\",\"score\":34.2147478390627,\"foundWords\":[\"wafer\",\"wafer-scale\",\"scale\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"wafer-scale\",\"offset\":171},{\"match\":\"wafer\",\"offset\":354},{\"match\":\"Scale\",\"offset\":1933}],\"excerpt\":\"Single-GPU-like Programming Model 是将整个 multi-chiplet/wafer-scale GPU（含多个 compute die）暴露为统一单 GPU 的编程模型，完全从软件层面抽象 multi-die topology 和 data placement，使编程体验与 monolithic GPU 相同。与之对应的是 Multi-GPU-like Programming Model（如 WSC-LLM、MoEntwine），将 wafer 暴露为多 GPU 系统，允许程序员精细控制每个 die，但需要通过 NCCL/NVSHMEM 等库管理显式的跨 die 通信。Single-GPU-like 模型与当前商业 multi-chiplet GPU（Blackw…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MoE Load Skewness (MoE负载倾斜度).md\",\"basename\":\"MoE Load Skewness (MoE负载倾斜度)\",\"score\":30.339951486851334,\"foundWords\":[\"wafer\",\"wafer-scale\",\"scale\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"scale\",\"offset\":389},{\"match\":\"scale\",\"offset\":425},{\"match\":\"-Scal\",\"offset\":1596},{\"match\":\"e-sca\",\"offset\":2029},{\"match\":\"在 wafer-sca\",\"offset\":2542}],\"excerpt\":\"…收到 3 倍于平均的 token。Skewness 仅影响 FFN compute 和 communication runtime：bottleneck GPU 的 FFN compute 时间被 scale by skewness；All-to-All 通信时间也被 scale by skewness：$(N-1)·skewness/N^2$（N=GPU 数）。\\n从算法pipeline角度拆解术语：\\nSkewness 直接影响 prediction strategy 选择（MoE-GPS Figure 7）：\\n- Low skewness (1.0-1.5)：Distribution-Only 由于 zero overhead 优势明显\\n- High skewness (1.5+)：Token-to-Expert 的高 accuracy 优势逐渐超越 predictor overhe…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Hardware-Managed HBM with ATU and PDU (硬件管理的HBM缓存).md\",\"basename\":\"Hardware-Managed HBM with ATU and PDU (硬件管理的HBM缓存)\",\"score\":29.95535397258385,\"foundWords\":[\"wafer\",\"wafer-scale\",\"scale\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"wafer-scale\",\"offset\":125},{\"match\":\"Scale\",\"offset\":2975}],\"excerpt\":\"Hardware-Managed HBM 是论文为 wafer-scale GPU D2D controller 提出的扩展机制，通过在 D2D controller 中集成 **Address Translation Unit (ATU)** 和 **Prediction Unit (PDU)**，实现对远程 HBM 中热门 expert 权重的自动本地缓存。在整个过程中，软件/CUDA 程序完全无感知——SM 发出的 memory request 的物理地址不变，硬件层自动判断数据是本地还是远程并路由。这与传统 GPU 将所有 HBM die 视为 uniform memory space（不区分 local vs remote）形成对比。…\"}],\"totalCount\":11,\"truncated\":false},\"effectiveQuery\":\"path:knowledge_notes Cerebras WSE wafer-scale engine Tesla Dojo chiplet architecture\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"16af853a-17b2-4211-9aec-4e6e854b6a55","uuid":"a7062aa2-885d-44bd-8094-7fecf5b4afd5","timestamp":"2026-05-31T11:39:17.772Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/Wafer-Scale Engine (WSE _ 晶圆级引擎).md\",\"basename\":\"Wafer-Scale Engine (WSE _ 晶圆级引擎)\",\"score\":758.6889998308116,\"foundWords\":[\"wafer\",\"wafer-scale\",\"scale\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Wafer-Scale\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Wafer-Scale\",\"offset\":44},{\"match\":\"Wafer-Scale\",\"offset\":1463}],\"excerpt\":\"## Wafer-Scale Engine (WSE / 晶圆级引擎)\\n术语是什么？\\nWafer-Scale Engine (WSE) 是 Cerebras Systems 推出的晶圆级 AI 加速器芯片。与传统的 multi-die GPU 不同，WSE 在整片 300mm 硅晶圆上集成计算核心，消除了芯片间通信（off-chip）的带宽瓶颈。WSE-2（第二代）使用 TSMC 7nm 工艺，在 46,225 mm² 面积上集成 2.6 万亿晶体管、850,000 个 AI 核心、40 GB on-chip SRAM 和 20 PB/s 内存带宽。系统形态为 CS-2（单 WSE-2 芯片的整机…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Wafer-Scale Multi-Chiplet GPU for MoE Serving (晶圆级多芯粒GPU的MoE推理).md\",\"basename\":\"Wafer-Scale Multi-Chiplet GPU for MoE Serving (晶圆级多芯粒GPU的MoE推理)\",\"score\":651.6118864814571,\"foundWords\":[\"wafer\",\"wafer-scale\",\"wafer,\",\"wafer/interposer\",\"scale\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Wafer-Scale\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Wafer-Scale\",\"offset\":112},{\"match\":\"wafer/interposer\",\"offset\":233},{\"match\":\"Wafer\",\"offset\":387},{\"match\":\"Wafer-scale\",\"offset\":626},{\"match\":\"wafer\",\"offset\":704},{\"match\":\"Wafer-scale\",\"offset\":1841},{\"match\":\"wafer,\",\"offset\":2295},{\"match\":\"wafer\",\"offset\":2383},{\"match\":\"Scale\",\"offset\":2597}],\"excerpt\":\"## Wafer-Scale Multi-Chiplet GPU for MoE Serving (晶圆级多芯粒GPU的MoE推理)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nWafer-Scale Multi-Chiplet GPU 是将多个 GPU compute die 和 HBM die 通过先进封装技术（如 TSMC CoWoS/SoW, Samsung X-Cube, Intel EMIB）集成在单个 wafer/interposer 上的 GPU 架构。论文研究的两种具体拓扑：(1) **Tesla Dojo**：5×5 2D mesh，…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/System-on-Wafer (SoW) Technology (晶圆级系统集成技术).md\",\"basename\":\"System-on-Wafer (SoW) Technology (晶圆级系统集成技术)\",\"score\":375.36811720857503,\"foundWords\":[\"wafer\",\"wafer-scale\",\"scale\",\"scale——可容纳\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Wafer\",\"offset\":13},{\"match\":\"Wafer\",\"offset\":103},{\"match\":\"scale——可容纳\",\"offset\":308},{\"match\":\"wafer\",\"offset\":2120},{\"match\":\"wafer-scale\",\"offset\":2291},{\"match\":\"wafer\",\"offset\":2538},{\"match\":\"Scale\",\"offset\":2607}],\"excerpt\":\"## System-on-Wafer (SoW) Technology (晶圆级系统集成技术)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nSystem-on-Wafer (SoW) 是 TSMC 的晶圆级封装技术，将多个 compute die 和 HBM die 直接集成在单个硅晶圆上，通过 Local Silicon Interconnect (LSI) 和 XSR SerDes 实现 die-to-die 互联。与传统的 multi-chip module (MCM) 或 2.5D interposer 方案（如 CoWoS）相比，SoW 的显著差异在于 scale…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowle