ion Unit (PDU)**，实现对远程 HBM 中热门 expert 权重的自动本地缓存。在整个过程中，软件/CUDA 程序完全无感知——SM 发出的 memory request 的物理地址不变，硬件层自动判断数据是本地还是远程并路由。这与传统 GPU 将所有 HBM die 视为 uniform memory space（不区分 local vs remote）形成对比。…\"}],\"totalCount\":11,\"truncated\":false},\"effectiveQuery\":\"path:knowledge_notes Cerebras WSE wafer-scale engine Tesla Dojo chiplet architecture\"}","structuredContent":{"result":{"mode":"omnisearch","hits":[{"filename":"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/Wafer-Scale Engine (WSE _ 晶圆级引擎).md","basename":"Wafer-Scale Engine (WSE _ 晶圆级引擎)","score":758.6889998308116,"foundWords":["wafer","wafer-scale","scale"],"matches":[{"match":"Wafer-Scale","offset":3},{"match":"Wafer-Scale","offset":44},{"match":"Wafer-Scale","offset":1463}],"excerpt":"## Wafer-Scale Engine (WSE / 晶圆级引擎)\n术语是什么？\nWafer-Scale Engine (WSE) 是 Cerebras Systems 推出的晶圆级 AI 加速器芯片。与传统的 multi-die GPU 不同，WSE 在整片 300mm 硅晶圆上集成计算核心，消除了芯片间通信（off-chip）的带宽瓶颈。WSE-2（第二代）使用 TSMC 7nm 工艺，在 46,225 mm² 面积上集成 2.6 万亿晶体管、850,000 个 AI 核心、40 GB on-chip SRAM 和 20 PB/s 内存带宽。系统形态为 CS-2（单 WSE-2 芯片的整机…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Wafer-Scale Multi-Chiplet GPU for MoE Serving (晶圆级多芯粒GPU的MoE推理).md","basename":"Wafer-Scale Multi-Chiplet GPU for MoE Serving (晶圆级多芯粒GPU的MoE推理)","score":651.6118864814571,"foundWords":["wafer","wafer-scale","wafer,","wafer/interposer","scale"],"matches":[{"match":"Wafer-Scale","offset":3},{"match":"Wafer-Scale","offset":112},{"match":"wafer/interposer","offset":233},{"match":"Wafer","offset":387},{"match":"Wafer-scale","offset":626},{"match":"wafer","offset":704},{"match":"Wafer-scale","offset":1841},{"match":"wafer,","offset":2295},{"match":"wafer","offset":2383},{"match":"Scale","offset":2597}],"excerpt":"## Wafer-Scale Multi-Chiplet GPU for MoE Serving (晶圆级多芯粒GPU的MoE推理)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nWafer-Scale Multi-Chiplet GPU 是将多个 GPU compute die 和 HBM die 通过先进封装技术（如 TSMC CoWoS/SoW, Samsung X-Cube, Intel EMIB）集成在单个 wafer/interposer 上的 GPU 架构。论文研究的两种具体拓扑：(1) **Tesla Dojo**：5×5 2D mesh，…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/System-on-Wafer (SoW) Technology (晶圆级系统集成技术).md","basename":"System-on-Wafer (SoW) Technology (晶圆级系统集成技术)","score":375.36811720857503,"foundWords":["wafer","wafer-scale","scale","scale——可容纳"],"matches":[{"match":"Wafer","offset":13},{"match":"Wafer","offset":103},{"match":"scale——可容纳","offset":308},{"match":"wafer","offset":2120},{"match":"wafer-scale","offset":2291},{"match":"wafer","offset":2538},{"match":"Scale","offset":2607}],"excerpt":"## System-on-Wafer (SoW) Technology (晶圆级系统集成技术)\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nSystem-on-Wafer (SoW) 是 TSMC 的晶圆级封装技术，将多个 compute die 和 HBM die 直接集成在单个硅晶圆上，通过 Local Silicon Interconnect (LSI) 和 XSR SerDes 实现 die-to-die 互联。与传统的 multi-chip module (MCM) 或 2.5D interposer 方案（如 CoWoS）相比，SoW 的显著差异在于 scale…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Expert Parallelism (EP _ 专家并行).md","basename":"Expert Parallelism (EP _ 专家并行)","score":49.39392048474575,"foundWords":["wafer","wafer-scale","scale","scalemoe:","scalemoe"],"matches":[{"match":"wafer-scale","offset":1263},{"match":"Wafer-Scale","offset":2272},{"match":"ScaleMoE","offset":4164},{"match":"ScaleMoE","offset":4346},{"match":"Wafer-Scale","offset":4772},{"match":"ScaleMoE:","offset":5432},{"match":"Scale","offset":5503},{"match":"scale","offset":6887}],"excerpt":"BTA 论文指出，在 wafer-scale 处理器上，EP 解决的是跨设备 expert 分布问题，但不能解决同一设备内 attention 与 expert 的 batch size 冲突。BTA 与 EP 是互补的：EP 跨晶圆/设备分布 expert，BTA 在同一设备内解耦 attention 和 expert 的 batch size。\n术语一般如何实现？如何使用？\n主流框架实现：\n- Megatron-Core：通过 `moe_ep_size` 参数配置 EP 并行度，与 TP/DP/PP 混合使用。推荐 Mixtral-8x7B 在 64 GPU 上用 TP=1, EP=8, PP=4。\n- De…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Two-Level Command Processor (两级命令处理器).md","basename":"Two-Level Command Processor (两级命令处理器)","score":41.47648800198789,"foundWords":["wafer","wafer-scale","scale","scaled"],"matches":[{"match":"wafer-scale","offset":124},{"match":"wafer","offset":222},{"match":"wafer-scale","offset":547},{"match":"wafer","offset":668},{"match":"scaled","offset":2272},{"match":"Scale","offset":2652}],"excerpt":"Two-Level Command Processor (CP) 是论文为 wafer-scale multi-chiplet GPU 提出的架构扩展，将传统 GPU 的单层 Command Processor 重新设计为两级层次结构：(1) **Global CP**（wafer 级）——维护全系统 expert selection 和 placement 信息，运行 Task Allocation Algorithm 和 Data-Driven Predictor，负责将 MoE kernel 拆分为 per-die 子 kernel；(2) **Local CP**（每 die 内）——接收 Global CP 的子 kernel 和 prediction 配置…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Multi-Die Task Allocation for MoE (多Die MoE任务分配).md","basename":"Multi-Die Task Allocation for MoE (多Die MoE任务分配)","score":37.13912084440806,"foundWords":["wafer","waferscale","wafer-scale","scale"],"matches":[{"match":"wafer-scale","offset":128},{"match":"waferscale","offset":2946},{"match":"Scale","offset":3118}],"excerpt":"Multi-Die Task Allocation 是运行在 wafer-scale GPU Global CP 上的启发式算法，将 MoE kernel 计算按 expert 拆分为 per-die 子任务，基于 expert 在各 die 上的分布信息和 cost model 将子任务分配到最优 die。核心创新是引入 **Candidate Mechanism**（扩展候选 die 到邻居 die，而不限于 expert 所在 die）和 **Block-Granularity Distribution**（以 block size=50 为单位分配请求，在效率和精度间折中）。该算法是 Insight 3（expert-placement-awar…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Expert Parallelism (专家并行).md","basename":"Expert Parallelism (专家并行)","score":34.6598838034594,"foundWords":["wafer","wafer-scale","scale"],"matches":[{"match":"**Wafer-sca","offset":4291},{"match":"在 wafer-sca","offset":4326},{"match":"在 waf","offset":4376},{"match":"P sca","offset":5028}],"excerpt":"- **Wafer-scale single-GPU-like EP**：在 wafer-scale multi-chiplet GPU 上，EP 意味着 expert 分布在 wafer 的不同 die 上（而非不同 GPU 节点）。由于 single-GPU-like programming model 不暴露 die-level 控制，论文通过硬件架构扩展（Global/Local CP + ATU/PDU + Task Allocation Algorithm）在硬件层实现 expert-placement-aware 的任务分配。关键挑战：local vs remote HBM acce…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Data-Driven Expert Predictor (数据驱动的专家预测器).md","basename":"Data-Driven Expert Predictor (数据驱动的专家预测器)","score":34.48322061921944,"foundWords":["wafer","wafer-scale","scale"],"matches":[{"match":"wafer-scale"