sk Allocation Algorithm）在硬件层实现 expert-placement-aware 的任务分配。关键挑战：local vs remote HBM access 延迟差距达 10-15×，但传统 GPU CP 无视 dielocation 做 uni…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Specification Table (GST _ GPU规格表).md\",\"basename\":\"GPU Specification Table (GST _ GPU规格表)\",\"score\":40.78837570329929,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multiplication\",\"multi-vector\",\"die\",\"die），存储该gpu型号的关键architectural\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"die），存储该GPU型号的关键architectural\",\"offset\":161},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1593},{\"match\":\"multi-vector\",\"offset\":2580},{\"match\":\"Multiplication\",\"offset\":4012}],\"excerpt\":\"GPU Specification Table (GST) 是QuCo论文提出的256-byte只读数据block，由GPU vendor在制造时写入（fused into the GPU die），存储该GPU型号的关键architectural parameters。内容包含：memory latencies（L1/L2/DRAM）、clock frequency、LDS size、number of compute units、arithmetic throughput（如FP32 FMA operations per cycle per SIMD）、DRAM bandwidth等QuCo firmware所需的全部硬件参数。GST的数据不暴露给host software或programmer，仅QuCo internal RISC-V firmware可读取——确保GPU…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/2.5D Silicon Interposer (2.5D 硅中介层).md\",\"basename\":\"2.5D Silicon Interposer (2.5D 硅中介层)\",\"score\":39.141949021889076,\"foundWords\":[\"multiple\",\"die\",\"dies（如\",\"dies\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"dies（如\",\"offset\":142},{\"match\":\"dies\",\"offset\":210},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":306},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":893},{\"match\":\"multiple\",\"offset\":1222}],\"excerpt\":\"2.5D silicon interposer 是一种封装集成技术，在 package substrate 和多个 dies（如 GPU + HBM stacks）之间插入一层硅中介层，通过硅基板上的微凸点（microbump）和硅通孔（TSV）实现 dies 之间的高速互联。相比传统 PCB 走线（毫米级线宽），silicon interposer 使用硅工艺的亚微米线宽金属层，实现更高的布线密度和信号完整性。Stratum 的 xPU die 和多个 Mono3D DRAM chips 通过 silicon interposer 互联，采用与 HBM3 兼容的 interposer I/O 标准（1024-bit data I/O, 6.4 Gbps/pin）。\\n从芯片设计角度拆解术语，比如术语如何在…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/PIM HUB (PIM Controller with Integrated Scheduling).md\",\"basename\":\"PIM HUB (PIM Controller with Integrated Scheduling)\",\"score\":33.53304736924711,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-channel\",\"die上以专用逻辑实现，位于各channel/bank的交汇处。其microarchitecture需满足：\",\"die上以专用逻辑实现\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"die上以专用逻辑实现，位于各channel/bank的交汇处。其microarchitecture需满足：\",\"offset\":1325},{\"match\":\"multi-channel\",\"offset\":1383}],\"excerpt\":\"PIM HUB通常在PIM module die上以专用逻辑实现，位于各channel/bank的交汇处。其microarchitecture需满足：(1) multi-channel command fan-out——将HUB级指令分发到目标channel；(2) channel间同步——通过barrier/SYNC机制确保inter-channel reduction的正确性；(3) 对host的抽象——HUB暴露统一的command interface，隐藏内部channel/bank拓扑。PIMphony通过修改CENT和NeuPIMs simulator实现HUB增强逻辑，在simulator中建模HUB内的D-Table/…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/Co-Packaged Optics (CPO).md\",\"basename\":\"Co-Packaged Optics (CPO)\",\"score\":33.38162839575537,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-die\",\"die\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":327},{\"match\":\"Multi-die\",\"offset\":697},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":738},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1019},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1247},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1297},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1604},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1788},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1804},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":2139},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":2148}],\"excerpt\":\"…eiver（通过面板插入 NIC 的 QSFP/OSFP 端口，中间经过 PCB trace + SerDes + retimer）不同，CPO 将光电器件（激光器、调制器、光电探测器、波导）与计算 die 通过硅 interposer、EMIB 或玻璃基板集成在同一 package 内。CPO 消除了芯片到面板光纤连接的多道电气-光学-电气转换，显著降低：(1) SerDes 功耗（每链路节省 3-5 pJ/bit）；(2) 信号衰减和 PCB trace 带宽限制；(3) 系统体积和光纤管理复杂度。CPO 被认为是下一代 >100 Tbps GPU I/O 带宽的关键使能技术。\\n从芯片设计角度拆解术语，比如术语如何在芯片设计中发挥作用，给出术语在芯片设计中运转流程的具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nCPO 的芯片级实现方案：\\n- Ayar Labs TeraPHY：使用硅光子…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/Wafer-Scale Engine (WSE _ 晶圆级引擎).md\",\"basename\":\"Wafer-Scale Engine (WSE _ 晶圆级引擎)\",\"score\":31.4535445034031,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-die\",\"die\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"multi-die\",\"offset\":109},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":357}],\"excerpt\":\"Wafer-Scale Engine (WSE) 是 Cerebras Systems 推出的晶圆级 AI 加速器芯片。与传统的 multi-die GPU 不同，WSE 在整片 300mm 硅晶圆上集成计算核心，消除了芯片间通信（off-chip）的带宽瓶颈。WSE-2（第二代）使用 TSMC 7nm 工艺，在 46,225 mm² 面积上集成 2.6 万亿晶体管、850,000 个 AI 核心、40 GB on-chip SRAM 和 20 PB/s 内存带宽。系统形态为 CS-2（单 WSE-2 芯片的整机系统）。\\n从芯片设计角度拆解术语：\\nWSE-2 的芯片设计核心特征：\\n1. **单晶圆集成**：84 个 die 通过专有互联技术拼接在单晶圆上，构成统一的 2D mesh 网络。每个 PE 通过 32-bit…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/NVIDIA Ada Lovelace Tensor Core INT8 (RTX 4090_3090 Consumer GPU Tensor Core).md\",\"basename\":\"NVIDIA Ada Lovelace Tensor Core INT8 (RTX 4090_3090 Consumer GPU Tensor Core)\",\"score\":26.64879733477073,\"foundWords\":[\"multiprocessor\",\"die\",\"die,\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"die,\",\"offset\":242},{\"match\":\"Multiprocessor\",\"offset\":948}],\"excerpt\":\"…ace Tensor Core (RTX 4090) 是 consumer GPU 上的第四代 Tensor Core，提供 INT8 和 FP16 矩阵乘加硬件加速。RTX 4090 (AD102 die, 128 SMs, boost clock ~2520 MHz) 的 Tensor Core 理论吞吐：INT8 = 660 TOPS (non-sparse) / 1320 TOPS (sparse)；FP16 = 330 TFLOPS (non-sparse) / 660 TFLOPS (sparse)。关键特性：(1) INT8 MMA (u8.u8.s32) 指令使 consumer GPU 上的 INT8 推理达到数据中心 GPU (A100: 624 TOPS) 相当甚至更高的 INT8 吞吐；(2) FP16+FP16 accumulator MMA (f16.f16.f…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/Virtual Bank (VBA) — Row Granularity Memory Bank Organization.md\",\"basename\":\"Virtual Bank (VBA) — Row Granularity Memory Bank Organization\",\"score\":25.39440587017007,\"foundWords\":[\"multiplexed\",\"die\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"multiplexed\",\"offset\":310},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":985},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1053}],\"excerpt\":\"…leaving 和 PC interleaving 以最大化带宽。VBA 将这些细节从 MC-DRAM 接口中移除，由两个来自不同 bank group 的 physical bank 以 time-multiplexed 方式组成，使得单个 VBA 即可独立提供满通道带宽。最终采用 VBA = 2 banks from different BGs (Figure 7d) + 2 PCs operate concurrently (Figure 8b)，无需修改 DRAM 内部数据路径宽度，有效 row size 从 1KB 升至 4KB，banks/channel 从 128 降至 32。\\n从芯片设计角度拆解术语：\\nVBA 的核心芯片设计决策在于避免增加 internal dataline 宽度。论文探索了 6 种 VBA 配置（3 种 bank group 消除方式 × 2 种 P…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/AMD Infinity Fabric (GPU Interconnect).md\",\"basename\":\"AMD Infinity Fabric (GPU Interconnect)\",\"score\":22.855765253050542,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-gpu\",\"die边缘\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"die边缘\",\"offset\":1357},{\"match\":\"Multi-GPU\",\"offset\":2101}],\"excerpt\":\"- 每link包含多lane串行链路（类似NVLink），集成在GPU die边缘\\n- 链路直接连接相邻GPU的IF ports，无需外部switch芯片（区别于NVIDIA NVSwitch需要独立switch芯片）\\n- 全连接拓扑使任意GPU pair通过单hop可达，延迟极低（<1μs）\\n- 跨GPU内存访问通过IF透明执行：GPU_A发出remote load → IF PHY → 串行链路 → 目标GPU_B的IF PHY → GPU_B的HBM controller → 返回数据沿相同路径\\n与NVIDIA NVLink/NVSwitch的对比：\\n- NVLink: NVIDIA的GPU互联，H100用NVLink 4.0 (900 GB/s双向，18…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Expert Skipping (in MoE LLMs_MLLMs).md\",\"basename\":\"Expert Skipping (in MoE LLMs_MLLMs)\",\"score\":10.62498138297889,\"foundWords\":[\"multimodal\",\"diep\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"n）、D\",\"offset\":1189},{\"match\":\"ts Multimo\",\"offset\":1514}],\"excerpt\":\"现有方法：NAEE（routing probability阈值判定）、MC-MoE（attention-aware protection）、DiEP（differentiable pruning with expert similarity）。MoDES在此基础上引入GMLG（全局层重要性×局部routing概率）和DMT（text/vision分别设阈值），配合Frontier Search找最优阈值。Custom CUDA kernel内嵌branch-free masked comparison实现，跳过expert路由为sentinel ID并在dispatch/gather阶段过滤。适用所有MoE架构的LLMs/MLLMs推理加速，尤其在高跳过率（>80%）下优势显著。\\n涉及论文标题：\\n- MoDES: Acce…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Globally-Modulated Local Gating (GMLG).md\",\"basename\":\"Globally-Modulated Local Gating (GMLG)\",\"score\":10.545311844944047,\"foundWords\":[\"multimodal\",\"diep\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"DiEP\",\"offset\":161},{\"match\":\"Multimodal\",\"offset\":1601}],\"excerpt\":\"…dulated Local Gating (GMLG) 是 MoDES 提出的 expert importance 评分机制。传统的 expert skipping 方法（如 NAEE、MC-MoE、DiEP）仅依赖当前层的 local routing probability $\\\\pi_i^{(l)}$ 决定跳过哪些 expert，忽略了不同层 expert 对模型最终输出的全局贡献差异。GMLG 将离线校准得到的层级别全局重要性因子 $\\\\alpha^{(l)}$ 与推理时的 local routing probability 相乘，得到综合考虑全局和局部贡献的 expert importance score：$s_i^{(l)} = \\\\alpha^{(l)} \\\\cdot \\\\pi_i^{(l)}$。\\n从算法pipeline角度拆解术语：\\nGMLG 的校准与推理流程：\\n```\\n# ===…\"}],\"totalCount\":19,\"truncated\":false},\"effectiveQuery\":\"path:knowledge_notes chiplet yield advantage multi-die integration design tradeoff\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"16af853a-17b2-4211-9aec-4e6e854b6a55","uuid":"e695dec0-e568-4e70-bea4-61b6dcd649d8","timestamp":"2026-05-31T11:39:19.456Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Multi-Die Task Allocation for MoE (多Die MoE任务分配).md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Die Task Allocation for MoE (多Die MoE任务分配)\",\"score\":740.004503371577,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-die\",\"multi-gpu-like，此算法可在\",\"multi-gpu-like\",\"die\",\"die（而非仅本地\",\"die_ids\",\"die），在\",\"die）和\",\"die，而不限于\",\"die。host\",\"die。核心创新是引入\",\"dies\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Die\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Die\",\"offset\":39},{\"match\":\"Multi-Die\",\"offset\":97},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":194},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":215},{\"match\":\"die。核心创新是引入\",\"offset\":248},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":289},{\"match\":\"die，而不限于\",\"offset\":297},{\"match\":\"die）和\",\"offset\":316},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":646},{\"match\":\"die_ids\",\"offset\":669},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":746},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":783},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":798},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":950},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":969},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":978},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1053},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1115},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1453},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1524},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1557},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1568},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1674},{\"match\":\"dies\",\"offset\":1775},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1789},{\"match\":\"dies\",\"offset\":1819},{\"match\":\"Dies\",\"offset\":1834},{\"match\":\"dies\",\"offset\":1845},{\"match\":\"dies\",\"offset\":1902},{\"match\":\"dies\",\"offset\":1916},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offs