"offset\":2371},{\"match\":\"Multi-Chiplet\",\"offset\":2465}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Chiplet GPU (MCM-GPU) Architecture / 多芯粒GPU架构\\n术语是什么？\\nMulti-Chiplet GPU（也称MCM-GPU）是一种将多个较小的GPU chiplet通过高密度封装（如interposer、硅桥）集成为单个逻辑GPU的架构。与传统的monolithic GPU（单个大die制造）不同，multi-chiplet GPU将计算资源（SM、cache、memory controller等）分布到多个物理die上，各chiplet之间通过inter-chiplet interconnect（如interposer上的NoC或cros…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Wafer-Scale Multi-Chiplet GPU for MoE Serving (晶圆级多芯粒GPU的MoE推理).md\",\"basename\":\"Wafer-Scale Multi-Chiplet GPU for MoE Serving (晶圆级多芯粒GPU的MoE推理)\",\"score\":353.28415764824615,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-chiplet\",\"multi-hop\",\"die\",\"die_of_expert\",\"die；\",\"die:\",\"die，同样\",\"die，每\",\"dies\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Chiplet\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"Multi-Chiplet\",\"offset\":124},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":159},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":169},{\"match\":\"die，每\",\"offset\":308},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":314},{\"match\":\"die，同样\",\"offset\":413},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":435},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":477},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":750},{\"match\":\"dies\",\"offset\":765},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":897},{\"match\":\"die_of_expert\",\"offset\":1084},{\"match\":\"die_of_expert\",\"offset\":1133},{\"match\":\"die:\",\"offset\":1158},{\"match\":\"multi-hop\",\"offset\":1266},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1539},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1573},{\"match\":\"die；\",\"offset\":1698},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1869},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":1927},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":2077},{\"match\":\"die\",\"offset\":2291},{\"match\":\"dies\",\"offset\":2354},{\"match\":\"dies\",\"offset\":2368},{\"match\":\"die:\",\"offset\":2438}],\"excerpt\":\"## Wafer-Scale Multi-Chiplet GPU for MoE Serving (晶圆级多芯粒GPU的MoE推理)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nWafer-Scale Multi-Chiplet GPU 是将多个 GPU compute die 和 HBM die 通过先进封装技术（如 TSMC CoWoS/SoW, Samsung X-Cube, Intel EMIB）集成在单个 wafer/interposer 上