Data Movement Forecasting/VIII.-RELATED-WORK.md\",\"basename\":\"VIII.-RELATED-WORK\",\"score\":117.90780720630465,\"foundWords\":[\"wafer\",\"wafer-scale\",\"scale\",\"scale.\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"scale\",\"offset\":656},{\"match\":\"scale.\",\"offset\":1812},{\"match\":\"Wafer-Scale\",\"offset\":1820},{\"match\":\"wafer-scale\",\"offset\":1888},{\"match\":\"wafer-scale\",\"offset\":2179}],\"excerpt\":\"…prefill and decode. None of these studies provides a comprehensive profiling across multiple large-scale (>200B) MoE models, nor do they present a data-movement-centric methodology to highlight the opportunities like this paper.\\nData movement optimization for MoE LLM inference Various prior works [9], [16], [31], [33], [80]–[87] have focused on improving the efficiency of MoE LLM inference by re…\"},{\"filename\":\"paper_secs/secs_moe/Orders in Chaos Enhancing Large-Scale MoE LLM Serving with Data Movement Forecasting/C.-Challenges-of-serving-MoE-with-future-GPUs.md\",\"basename\":\"C.-Challenges-of-serving-MoE-with-future-GPUs\",\"score\":114.76565448468149,\"foundWords\":[\"wafer\",\"wafer-scale\",\"scale\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"wafer-scale\",\"offset\":85},{\"match\":\"scale\",\"offset\":262},{\"match\":\"wafer-scale\",\"offset\":869},{\"match\":\"Wafer-scale\",\"offset\":1261},{\"match\":\"Wafer\",\"offset\":1368},{\"match\":\"scale\",\"offset\":2136}],\"excerpt\":\"Unlike current multi-GPU systems, wafer-scale GPUs can fit entire MoE models on a single chip and support batch sizes over 10,000. However, current GPU architectures introduce two key limitations for such large-scale chips.\\nSimplistic Task Allocation. Current GPUs integrate a CPU in their SoC to serve as a command processor and all…\"},{\"filename\":\"paper_secs/secs_moe/Orders in Chaos Enhancing Large-Scale MoE LLM Serving with Data Movement Forecasting/Algorithm-2-Prefill-Guided-Expert-Placement.md\",\"basename\":\"Algorithm-2-Prefill-Guided-Expert-Placement\",\"score\":113.6149959