{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"beb1f67a-0eda-43eb-91d1-ca38276cf25f","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have sufficient context to write the answer. Let me compile everything and write a comprehensive answer for Q6.2.\n\nLet me organize my findings by logical chain node:\n\n**S1 (Chiplet paradigm)**: Covered — Multi-Chiplet GPU architecture, interposer, UCIe, DFBM. Key notes: knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/Multi-Chiplet GPU (MCM-GPU) Architecture, knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/2.5D Silicon Interposer, paper DFBM VII.\n\n**S2 (Wafer-Scale paradigm)**: Covered — WSE, SoW, Dojo. Key notes: knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/Wafer-Scale Engine (WSE), knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/System-on-Wafer (SoW) Technology, knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Wafer-Scale Multi-Chiplet GPU.\n\n**S3 (MoE expert parallelism, all-to-all)**: Covered extensively. Key notes: Expert Parallelism, Multi-Die Task Allocation, Two-Level CP, Hardware-Managed HBM.\n\n**S4 (DiT diffusion iteration)**: GAP — no direct notes on DiT + chiplet/wafer-scale. But I can infer from the diffusion iteration characteristics (iterative denoising, sequential dependency across timesteps) and chip design principles.\n\n**S5 (Multimodal heterogeneous encoder)**: GAP — no direct notes. Can infer from heterogeneous compute requirements.\n\n**S6 (Video spatiotemporal attention)**: GAP — no direct notes. Can infer from long sequence and memory requirements.\n\n**S7 (Tradeoffs: bandwidth, power, area, yield, scalability)**: Partially covered — DFBM paper discusses area/power, Orders in Chaos discusses overhead <0.04%, WSE notes discuss yield challenges.\n\n**S8 (Impact on multi-operator concurrency)**: Covered through the Orders in Chaos experiment results and architecture analysis.\n\nNow let me write the answer. The answer should be for **L6 芯片设计** level with the **硬件体系结构** focus. Per the L6 requirements:\n- Mermaid flowchart chip topology (Chiplet interconnect, Die-to-Die interface, etc.)\n- Evaluation table (process node, die area, power, interconnect protocol, bandwidth, TOPS/W)\n- Each diagram/table followed by 注解 section\n- Main content ≥3 note evidence, auxiliary ≥1\n\nFor the 侧重标签 \"硬件架构和运行时\":\n- Output section order: 方法细节（数据流/架构/运行时调度）→ 实验环境 → 实现(aux) → 是什么？(aux) → 方法对比表\n\nLet me now write this comprehensive answer. I'll target >100 lines as required.","signature":"beb1f67a-0eda-43eb-91d1-ca38276cf25f"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":91331,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"16af853a-17b2-4211-9aec-4e6e854b6a55","uuid":"40893ef9-2a22-4cfe-a135-d04e4b8f2378"}
